dded separately will use actualLatoBlack900 headline>=51px and labels>=33px, compact35px one-line MONEYBERG NEWS BRIEF, CONSUMER SENTIMENT category; actualGeorgia400 body>=35px/source>=33px, allwithin x104\u2013961,y164\u20131536. Render only the quiet background, no graphic text."
